{"synopsis":"Para Subkontraktor itu tidak lebih dari sekedar Robot yang aku berikan akses kehidupan.\n\nJadi Wajar saja jika aku memeras segalanya dari mereka.\n\nNamun setelah dikhianati oleh Grup tempatku bekerja, aku membuka mataku dalam tubuh yang baru dan akhirnya melihat dari sudut pandang air mata para “Robot” itu.\n\nSetelah memperoleh kehidupan kedua di ambang kematian, dapatkah jiwaku kali ini terselamatkan?","alternative_title":"Fair Trade Committee 공정거래위원회","author":"Hyunwoo, Kwon Oh-Joon","artist":"taibogi","chapters":[{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"d6e15d05-4c16-4cde-bec3-80c80dc1da05","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"2243c077-2b89-44b6-8a3f-45775818fa7f","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"412b4dd9-c150-47ac-acf8-071aaf82eac3","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"be5d6340-8f6a-4543-b645-fb821d8d2bfc","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"1bf50c33-8152-4417-90c1-800eca6187da","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"c3d6ed2f-b7cd-4c20-9bce-8fb587b21492","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"dfa5d3b3-692d-449f-be01-bd9708df75d5","date":"2026-05-11","images":[]},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"e3a3e57f-1efe-474a-86eb-d8931f23195f","date":"2026-05-04","images":[]},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"1e96435a-5298-42e5-b967-f2003ddf1c5d","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"9860d407-e5c6-4951-86ff-37cd6ee62de0","date":"2026-04-22","images":[]},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"4708ca81-6f86-4ea2-8e8a-63de9fe5a523","date":"2026-04-06","images":[]},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"7f9eaa74-b93b-4b95-88ec-1eb79729ce5c","date":"2026-03-29","images":[]},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"8c1d62e2-adea-43eb-84c8-59630be38b78","date":"2026-03-22","images":[]},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"ab75980